{"3166160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Oops! You're the Hero!", "steam_appid": 3166160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After stealing a forgotten artifact, a Thief finds himself marked as the unwilling ‘Hero’. Follow him as he journeys across the land, fighting monsters or exploring ways to go around them, all to give back the item he stole in the first place.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of the Thief, full of attitude and snark as he begrudgingly makes his way with his new, always- talking companion, Tut Puff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level by level, discover what it means to be a hero or avoid responsibility through different pathways and secrets scattered throughout</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of Othaya, a world that has moved on from magic and monsters. When they threaten the existence of the common folk, how do you respond to it, Hero?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat happens when you feel it is worth the fight. Want to charge forward and face the challenge? Each boss is waiting to sink their teeth into the great and mighty “Hero”. Equipped with a sword, use your skills and wit to get a leg up against your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💚<strong><u>Exploration of a fantasy world where YOU are the target</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166160/extras/3918520d82def2c447fcbfd0b86c3fbd.poster.avif?t=1784401030\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.a