 playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166160/extras/3918520d82def2c447fcbfd0b86c3fbd.poster.avif?t=1784401030\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166160/extras/3918520d82def2c447fcbfd0b86c3fbd.webm?t=1784401030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166160/extras/3918520d82def2c447fcbfd0b86c3fbd.mp4?t=1784401030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️<strong><u>Combat with massive monsters who rule their biome and offer a challenge with their abilities</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166160/extras/062b6a792e11caf653e6b67cca23e424.poster.avif?t=1784401030\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166160/extras/062b6a792e11caf653e6b67cca23e424.webm?t=1784401030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166160/extras/062b6a792e11caf653e6b67cca23e424.mp4?t=1784401030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖<strong><u>Story-rich narrative that blends humor and attitude</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166160/extras/4be44f020a5eed66c682786fb7b5b97b.poster.avif?t=1784401030\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166160/extras/4be44f020a5eed66c682786fb7b5b97b.webm?t=1784401030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/